  "description": "When Lee Yoojung’s boss runs off with her money and her boyfriend disappears into the night, she’s not having the greatest time. Sure, her job wasn’t great and her boyfriend was nothing special, but did they really have to do this?! After an evening lamenting to a friend, she learns of a juicy opportunity…an interview at a company, but everything has to be kept top-secret! Intrigued and in need of new employment, Yoojung decides to give it a shot. With the promise of super sexy colleagues and oh-so-exciting new responsibilities, will Yoojung truly be able to satisfy her potential new bosses?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
